Subject: [PATCH] fix(control): stop LAN ICMP redirects by writing
 conf/all/send_redirects too (#1125)

Co-authored-by: Markson Hon <50002150+MarksonHon@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 control/send_redirects_test.go | 103 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 control/utils.go               |  65 +++++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 158 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 control/send_redirects_test.go

--- /dev/null
+++ b/dae-core/control/send_redirects_test.go
@@ -0,0 +1,103 @@
+/*
